"""
Program  : odp_filechecker
Language : snakemake
Date     : 2025-09-04
Author   : Darrin T. Schultz
Email    : darrin.schultz@univie.ac.at
Github   : https://github.com/conchoecia/odp
License  : GNU GENERAL PUBLIC LICENSE, Version 3, 29 June 2007. See the LICENSE file.

Description:
  The purpose of this script is to check the input files for an odp
  run with common issues that would cause problems later in the pipeline.

  This was split off of the main pipeline, largely because it previously added a
  computational bottleneck. The checks were run in a single rule that was resource-hungry
  and often failed. Splitting that rule into multiple smaller rules took snakemake overhead
  out of the main odp pipeline.

Usage instructions:
  - Run it with the same config file as the main pipeline, in the same directory.
"""

